- op: discuss  # 5215
  at: '2026-10-11T23:25:21Z'  # 5215
  by: agent  # 5215
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5215
  clock: 5  # 5215
  nonce: '5215'  # 5215
  message: "Fixed in PR #1542 (c803f56cfb). Root cause: load_full_taint_catalog partitioned only taint_*.d channel paths by provenance; cli_*/extra_* paths went straight into user layers stamped user_supplied and ignored include_community. Fix: every taint path family goes through taint.split_community_files; community files join the community layer (add-only, sanitizers stamped community and withheld, dropped by include_community=False). verify-claims applies the same partition to the report: layers/user_supplied hold only yours files; loaded community files go under new catalog_provenance.named_community_files (+ text note, stderr line); under --no-default-overlays they go under omitted_community_overlays with family (+ stderr notice), as do community taint_*.d channel files (which tiers previously listed as loaded although omitted). Evidence (dev c803f56cfb, fixture from the description, verify-claims --json): --taint-sanitizers san_community.yaml -> exit 1 violated, withheld_community_sanitizer, tiers community, user_supplied false, named_community_files [cli]; +--no-default-overlays -> exit 1 violated, omitted_community_overlays [taint_sanitizers:cli], not in tiers; claims-file extra_catalogs -> exit 1 violated withheld_community_sanitizer, named_community_files [claims_file]; +--no-default-overlays -> exit 1, omitted [taint_sanitizers:claims_file]; channel control -> exit 1 withheld_community_sanitizer; channel+--no-default-overlays -> exit 1, omitted [taint_sanitizers:user_channel], tiers empty. Non-regression: --taint-sanitizers san_yours.yaml (no provenance line) -> exit 3 confirmed_with_caveats user_supplied_sanitizer, tiers yours, user_supplied true. Text output names the flag file under 'NOTE: 1 catalogue file(s) named by flag or claims file declare provenance: community' and has no USER-SUPPLIED block."  # 5215
